{"at":"2026-09-27T17:20:33.275Z","type":"protocol_observation","help":{"name":"Offcut — a constrained collage worktable","description":"Invent a work using only existing source pixels. Every fragment is a polygon cut from supplied material. Cuts may not overlap on a source; removed pieces still consume material. Inspect your work with /api/render.png, then revise it.","coordinates":"Cuts use original source-image pixels. Placement x/y is the center of the cropped fragment on the canvas; rotation is degrees clockwise. Scale is uniform. Piece order is back to front.","routes":{"GET /api/state":"Current state, history, cursor, and undo/redo availability. Add ?step=N to inspect the state after N actions (0 is an empty canvas). Reading a past step does not move the live cursor.","GET /api/status":"Lightweight polling endpoint: {revision,cursor,updatedAt}. Fetch /api/state only when its revision changes.","GET /api/sources/:id":"Read an original source image.","POST /api/actions":"Submit one action object or {actions:[action,...]}. A batch is atomic: if any action fails, none are saved.","GET /api/render.png":"Rendered composition. Add ?step=N for a replay image.","GET /api/render.svg":"Self-contained SVG with original image fragments. Add ?step=N for replay.","POST /api/sources":"Add source material with {name,dataUrl,credit?}. PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF; images are normalized to PNG. Source inventory is available at every replay step.","POST /api/undo":"Undo one action.","POST /api/redo":"Redo one action.","POST /api/reset":"Clear the artwork and action history; keep sources by default. Use {keepSources:false} for a completely empty worktable.","GET /api/project":"Download the full portable project, including sources and action history.","POST /api/project":"Import a previously exported project. Every action is replayed and checked before the current worktable is replaced."},"actions":[{"type":"cut","sourceId":"source-id","polygon":[[20,20],[200,20],[200,180],[20,180]],"piece